---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Gestalt Psychotherapy in Nepal | Nepal Hypnosis" description="Discover experiential Gestalt psychotherapy in Kathmandu focusing on present-moment awareness, personal responsibility, and emotional integration.">
  <main class="py-16 bg-[#FAF8F5]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-[#e2e8f0]">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase mb-3 block">Experiential Therapy</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-6">Gestalt Psychotherapy in Nepal</h1>
      
      <div class="prose max-w-none text-[#475569] space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-[#173A7A]">
          Gestalt psychotherapy is an experiential, client-centered approach that emphasizes self-awareness, personal responsibility, and present-moment experiences.
        </p>
        <p>
          Rather than simply talking about past events abstractly, Gestalt therapy encourages clients to experience and explore how past unfinished business manifests in their immediate bodily sensations, emotions, and behaviors right now.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 bg-[#F5F1EA] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-2">Experience Gestalt Therapy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4">Inquire about individual therapy or specialized Gestalt training modules.</p>
          <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">
            Request a Consultation →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>